(text "24 VAC in on J3, PTC F1, bridge D1-D4, C3 470 uF: VS about 35 V DC against COM, out to INT on J1.6/J1.7 and into U3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 270.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "6f6d2076-4fda-42da-9d97-fca96bf53f5f"))
(text "U3 makes 5.1 V isolated for the Pi: C4 at its output, J4 to a USB-C pigtail. Remote (pin 3) open = on. COM never meets GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 276.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "96bcafeb-3c78-4397-b6b0-5c4649d6546f"))
